  "referenceNumber": "RUS0712",
  "remarks": "\nColonel Alexander Krivets BAF has been involved in engaging in and providing support for actions that have destabilised Ukraine or undermined or threatened the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine, namely, being in command of Lida Airbase, which has hosted Russian Military Aircraft used for attacks on Ukrainian targets during the current invasion.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
